---
description: Deploy the app to production to make the site live
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Production deployment uses the combined Node server (`pnpm build` then `pnpm start`):

- The server serves static assets from `dist/spa` and handles `/api/*` routes via Express.
- Verify the build locally with `pnpm build` before deploying.
- Do not ask the user to run commands in the terminal; use the Bash tool when needed.

For hosted deployments (Vercel, Railway, etc.), use the appropriate MCP integration if available. Otherwise, deploy the built `dist/` output with a Node runtime.

You can also suggest sharing the [Open Preview](#open-preview), but explain that it won't be a production-ready link.
